{"info": {"author": "Akeyless Security", "author_email": "support@akeyless.io", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Intended Audience :: Developers", "License :: OSI Approved :: Apache Software License", "Natural Language :: English", "Operating System :: OS Independent", "Programming Language :: Python", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.5", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.6", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.7", "Topic :: Security"], "description": "########################\nAkeyless Python Cloud Id\n########################\n\nRetrieves cloud identity\n\nCurrently, AWS, GCP, Azure and Alibaba Cloud are supported.\nIn order to get cloud identity you should import this package and call the relevant method per your chosen CSP:\n- AWS: \"generate\" (If no aws access id/key and token are provided they will be retrieved automatically from the default session.)\n- GCP: \"generateGcp\"\n- Azure: \"generateAzure\"\n- Alibaba Cloud: \"generateAlibaba\" (If no access key/secret are provided they will be retrieved from environment variables or an ECS RAM role.)\n\nMinimum requirements\n====================\n\n* Python 3.5+\n* urllib3 >= 1.15\n* requests\n\nOptional Dependencies\n====================\n\n* boto3\n* google-auth\n* azure-identity\n\nInstallation\n============\n\n.. code::\n    pip install akeyless-python-cloud-id\n\n**AWS:**\n\nTo install with AWS:\n\n.. code::\n\n    pip install akeyless-python-cloud-id[aws]\n\nThe following additional packages will be installed:\n\n* boto3\n\n**GCP:**\n\nTo install with GCP:\n\n.. code::\n\n    pip install akeyless-python-cloud-id[gcp]\n\nThe following additional packages will be installed:\n\n* google-auth\n\nTo install with Azure:\n\n.. code::\n\n    pip install akeyless-python-cloud-id[azure]\n\nThe following additional packages will be installed:\n\n* azure-identity\n\n*****\nUsage\n*****\n\nSuch code can be used, for example, in order to retrieve secrets from Akeyless as part of AWS Code Pipeline:\n\n.. code::\n    pip install git+https://github.com/akeylesslabs/akeyless-python-sdk\n\n    import akeyless_api_gateway\n    from akeyless_cloud_id import CloudId\n\n    configuration = akeyless_api_gateway.Configuration()\n    configuration.host=\"http://<api-gateway-host>:<port>\"\n\n    api_instance = akeyless_api_gateway.DefaultApi(akeyless_api_gateway.ApiClient(configuration))\n\n    cloud_id = CloudId()\n    # for AWS use:\n    id = cloud_id.generate()\n    # For Azure use:\n    id = cloud_id.generateAzure()\n    # For GCP use:\n    id = cloud_id.generateGcp()\n    # For Alibaba Cloud use:\n    id = cloud_id.generateAlibaba()\n\n    access_id = event['CodePipeline.job']['data']['actionConfiguration']['configuration']['UserParameters']\n\n    auth_response = api_instance.auth(access_id, access_type=\"aws_iam\", cloud_id=id)\n    token = auth_response.token\n\n    postgresPassword = api_instance.get_secret_value(\"PostgresPassword\", token)\n\n\n*******\nLicense\n*******\nThis SDK is distributed under the `Apache License, Version 2.0`_ see LICENSE.txt for more information.\n\n\n.. _Apache License, Version 2.0: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["Author", "Author-Email", "Classifier", "Description", "Description-Content-Type", "Home-Page", "Keywords", "License", "License-File", "Provides-Extra", "Requires-Dist", "Summary"], "home_page": "https://www.akeyless.io/", "keywords": "AKEYLESS Cloud ID", "license": "Apache 2.0", "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "akeyless-cloud-id", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/akeyless-cloud-id/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/akeyless-cloud-id/", "project_urls": {"Homepage": "https://www.akeyless.io/"}, "provides_extra": ["aws", "gcp", "azure"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/akeyless-cloud-id/0.3.2/", "requires_dist": ["urllib3>=1.15", "requests", "boto3; extra == \"aws\"", "google-auth; extra == \"gcp\"", "azure-identity; extra == \"azure\""], "requires_python": null, "summary": "AKEYLESS Cloud ID Retriever", "version": "0.3.2", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "releases": {"0.3.0": [{"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": {"sha256": "76a7a5c0fe8fe8aaab6eb6090fde2904913ba16a2634b97d948edb0370f2f459"}, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "352c59332cf95cec050acf51f5b65472c167b64e094c9aad4dc4965de2fe2a5e", "md5": "d9a7dc2690cf379245274d016a940695", "sha256": "d98cb039a276a81a88f8e85ae1a5c9cee744d94d38af37144d51d7bb5a8aae58"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "akeyless_cloud_id-0.3.0-py3-none-any.whl", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "d9a7dc2690cf379245274d016a940695", "packagetype": "bdist_wheel", "python_version": "py3", "requires_python": null, "size": 8586, "upload_time": "2025-03-23T08:46:16", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2025-03-23T08:46:16.978281Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/35/2c/59332cf95cec050acf51f5b65472c167b64e094c9aad4dc4965de2fe2a5e/akeyless_cloud_id-0.3.0-py3-none-any.whl", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, {"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": false, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "416a53d1fd8f06b5bf1df19e00e604b26cb7c3d60bbce273e417c0513dc04705", "md5": "34385dbbe5ef21afe52a85bcda750dcc", "sha256": "855d1e7a621676390013ba740a1dc2b9c1d82c82acf6785ea7daddca60f6d893"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "akeyless_cloud_id-0.3.0.tar.gz", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "34385dbbe5ef21afe52a85bcda750dcc", "packagetype": "sdist", "python_version": "source", "requires_python": null, "size": 8314, "upload_time": "2025-03-23T08:46:18", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2025-03-23T08:46:18.280112Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/41/6a/53d1fd8f06b5bf1df19e00e604b26cb7c3d60bbce273e417c0513dc04705/akeyless_cloud_id-0.3.0.tar.gz", "yanked": fals